# Plaza of Heroes' any-color mana is for legendary spells only (CR 106.6). Turn 3 Bot1 taps the first Plaza for {R}
# (restricted) with Mox Pearl and Mox Sapphire untapped and Ragavan, a legendary creature, in play (cast on turn 1 with
# that Plaza's restricted {R}, so no source of unrestricted red exists). The pool is {R}
# (LegendarySpells) and two unrestricted mana, three in all, yet:
#   - Llanowar Elves is not offered: restricted mana can't cast a nonlegendary spell (no Mox or other Plaza makes {G});
#   - the second Plaza's "{3}, {T}, Exile this land" is not offered: restricted mana can't pay an activation.
# A Mox Jet then supplies the third unrestricted mana and the same activation is offered (the positive control) and
# is paid by exactly those three Moxen, the restricted {R} left over, so the activation costs {3} and no more.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plaza of Heroes
Plaza of Heroes
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Ragavan, Nimble Pilferer
Mox Jet
Island
Llanowar Elves
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

